.TH FIERCE-NG 1 "2026" "fierce-ng 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fierce\-ng \- AI\-assisted DNS reconnaissance and attack\-surface mapping
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fierce\-ng scan
.I DOMAIN
.RB [ \-\-mode
.IR MODE ]
.RB [ \-\-brute ]
.RB [ \-\-ml ]
.RB [ \-\-shodan ]
.RB [ \-\-wordlist
.IR FILE ]
.RB [ \-\-out
.IR DIR ]
.RB [ \-\-diff
.IR JSON ]
.br
.B fierce\-ng train
.RI [ CORPUS ]
.RI [ OUTPUT ]
.br
.B fierce\-ng version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fierce\-ng
is a modern replacement for the classic \fBfierce\fR DNS reconnaissance tool.
It blends passive OSINT (Certificate Transparency, Shodan) with active DNS
enumeration under an explicit stealth budget, uses a lightweight character
n\-gram model to predict likely subdomains beyond static wordlists, builds a
property graph of the attack surface and assigns each finding a 0\-100 risk
score. Every run emits a signed, reproducible manifest.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B scan
Run a reconnaissance scan against \fIDOMAIN\fR and write JSON, CSV, HTML,
GraphML and manifest artifacts to the output directory.
.TP
.B train
Train the ML subdomain predictor on \fICORPUS\fR (one hostname/label per line,
e.g. Rapid7 Project Sonar or SecLists). With no corpus, the built\-in seed
list is used.
.SH SCAN OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-mode " MODE"
One of \fBpassive\fR (OSINT only), \fBactive\fR (DNS only), \fBhybrid\fR
(both; default) or \fBauto\fR (passive\-first, escalate if yield is low).
.TP
.B \-\-brute
Enable subdomain brute\-force.
.TP
.B \-\-ml
Use the ML predictor to rank/generate brute\-force candidates.
.TP
.B \-\-shodan
Query Shodan (requires the \fBSHODAN_API_KEY\fR environment variable).
.TP
.BI \-\-wordlist " FILE"
Use a custom wordlist instead of the built\-in list.
.TP
.BI \-\-qps " N"
Maximum queries per second per resolver (default 10).
.TP
.BI \-\-jitter " SECONDS"
Random additional delay between queries (default 0.15).
.TP
.BI \-\-out " DIR"
Output directory (default \fBout\fR).
.TP
.BI \-\-diff " JSON"
Compare against a previous scan's JSON export and alert on changes.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SHODAN_API_KEY
API key for the optional Shodan collector.
.TP
.B FIERCE_NG_SIGNING_KEY
HMAC key used to sign the run manifest for auditability.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Full AI\-assisted hybrid scan:
.B fierce\-ng scan example.com \-\-mode hybrid \-\-brute \-\-ml
.TP
Low\-noise passive scan:
.B fierce\-ng scan example.com \-\-mode passive
.TP
Continuous monitoring with alerting:
.B fierce\-ng scan example.com \-\-diff out/example_com.json
.SH ETHICS
Only scan assets you own or are explicitly authorized to test. See
.B /usr/share/doc/fierce\-ng/ETHICS.md .
.SH AUTHOR
G.I.K. Perera.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dig (1),
.BR host (1),
.BR amass (1)
